'''Fara's office''' was a structure under a [[Unidentified city (At Attin)|city]] on the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. It was used by [[Fara]].<ref name="You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Fara's office first appeared in "[[You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates]]"<ref name="You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates" /> the seventh episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 24]], [[2024]].<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1861409832349172011|''[[Star Wars]]''|date=2024-11-26|quote=Mark your calendars. 🗓️ On December 2, stream the two-episode series premiere of #SkeletonCrew, only on @DisneyPlus.|archiveurl=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/uxgSx|archivefile=File:StarWars-SkeletonCrewSchedule-Twitter.png}}</ref>

